<span class="label">What is All-on-4?</span><h2 class="title">A Complete Arch on <em>4 Implants</em></h2><p class="desc">All-on-4 restores an entire jaw using only four strategically placed implants. The two rear fixtures are tilted at 45° to maximize bone contact — eliminating the need for sinus lifts or complex bone grafting in most cases.</p></div><div class="reveal -delay-1" data-anim="up"><ul class="feat-list"><li><div class="fi-icon">🦷</div><div class="fi-text">
<strong>4 implants per arch</strong>
<span>2 vertical anteriors + 2 tilted posteriors for optimal load distribution</span></div></li><li><div class="fi-icon">⚡</div><div class="fi-text">
<strong>Fixed teeth the same day</strong>
<span>A provisional prosthesis is attached immediately after implant placement</span></div></li><li><div class="fi-icon">🔩</div><div class="fi-text">
<strong>Titanium bar reinforcement</strong>
<span>Distributes occlusal forces evenly for long-term structural stability</span></div></li><li><div class="fi-icon">🏥</div><div class="fi-text">
<strong>Avoids complex surgeries</strong>
<span>Angular placement bypasses sinuses and nerve pathways with precision</span></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="procedure" id="procedure" data-surface="dark"><div class="procedure-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="proc-header " data-anim="up">
<span class="label">Step by Step</span><h2 class="title title-white" style="text-align:center">The All-on-4 <em>Procedure</em></h2><p class="desc desc-white" style="margin:0 auto;text-align:center">From your first consultation in Istanbul to your final smile — every step mapped out with precision and transparency.</p></div><div class="timeline"><div class="tl-item right " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-empty"></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">🔍</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 01</div></div><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Day 1 — Istanbul</span><h3>Examination &#038; 3D Diagnosis</h3><p>Full clinical consultation, panoramic X-rays, and CBCT 3D scan to assess bone density and volume. Anatomical landmarks (sinuses, nerves) are mapped, and systemic health conditions are reviewed. Your VeaHealth coordinator accompanies you throughout.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
~2 hours · Same arrival day possible</div></div></div><div class="tl-item left " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Day 1–2 · Planning</span><h3>Digital Treatment Planning</h3><p>CAD/CAM software is used to virtually position all 4 implants, simulating the ideal angulation and depth. The titanium bar and prosthetic arch are designed digitally. Bite function, aesthetics, and bone engagement are all optimized before a single drill touches the jaw.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
12–24 hours planning phase</div></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">💻</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 02</div></div><div class="tl-empty"></div></div><div class="tl-item right " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-empty"></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">🔧</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 03</div></div><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Day 2–3 · Surgery</span><h3>Implant Placement Surgery</h3><p>Four titanium implants are surgically placed under local anesthesia or IV sedation. The 2 anterior fixtures are vertical; the 2 posterior ones are tilted at 45° to maximize engagement with available bone volume — avoiding sinus anatomy entirely. Surgery takes 2–4 hours per arch.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
2–4 hours per arch · Sedation available</div></div></div><div class="tl-item left " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Same Day · Immediate Load</span><h3>Same-Day Provisional Prosthesis</h3><p>A fixed temporary bridge is attached on the same day — or within 24 hours — of implant placement. You leave the clinic with functional, aesthetic teeth. This immediate loading protocol restores confidence instantly while osseointegration begins beneath the surface.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
You leave Istanbul with a full smile</div></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">😊</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 04</div></div><div class="tl-empty"></div></div><div class="tl-item right " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-empty"></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">⏳</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 05</div></div><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Months 3–6 · Healing</span><h3>Osseointegration &#038; Remote Follow-Up</h3><p>The titanium implants gradually fuse with the jawbone. VeaHealth provides a structured remote aftercare protocol: digital check-ins, photo assessments, and direct access to your treatment coordinator from your home country. Any concerns are addressed promptly without requiring immediate travel.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
3–6 months osseointegration window</div></div></div><div class="tl-item left " data-anim="up"><div class="tl-content">
<span class="tl-tag">Month 4–6 · Return Visit</span><h3>Final Zirconia Prosthesis Placement</h3><p>Once full osseointegration is confirmed, you return to Istanbul for your definitive restoration. A custom-milled zirconia or high-grade acrylic bridge — fabricated to match your natural tooth shade, bite alignment, and facial aesthetics — is permanently secured. This is your final smile.</p><div class="tl-timing">
<svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
2–4 day return visit · Full restoration</div></div><div class="tl-center"><div class="tl-node">✨</div><div class="tl-step-badge">Step 06</div></div><div class="tl-empty"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="materials" id="materials"><div class="container"><div class="" data-anim="up">
<span class="label">Components</span><h2 class="title">Materials &#038; <em>Technology</em></h2><p class="desc">Every component is chosen for biocompatibility, longevity, and aesthetics. VeaHealth uses only premium-tier systems.</p></div><div class="mat-grid " data-anim="up"><div class="mat-card"><div class="mat-card-top">
<span class="mat-icon">🔩</span><h3>Titanium Implant Fixtures</h3></div><p>Grade IV/V titanium — biocompatible, corrosion-resistant, and proven to osseointegrate reliably. VeaHealth exclusively uses Straumann and Nobel Biocare fixtures: the two most clinically validated brands worldwide. They withstand decades of occlusal loading without structural compromise.</p></div><div class="mat-card"><div class="mat-card-top">
<span class="mat-icon">🏗️</span><h3>All-on-4 Titanium Bar</h3></div><p>The milled titanium framework connects all 4 implants into a single rigid structure, distributing bite forces evenly across the arch. This prevents stress concentration on any individual implant and is the backbone of long-term prosthetic stability.</p></div><div class="mat-card"><div class="mat-card-top">
<span class="mat-icon">💎</span><h3>Zirconia Bridge</h3></div><p>Monolithic zirconia is the premium choice for the prosthetic arch — ceramic-hard, stain-resistant, and indistinguishable from natural enamel. It outlasts acrylic by years and eliminates the brittleness of layered porcelain. Clinical studies (Silva et al., 2019) confirm superior fit with CAD/CAM fabrication.</p></div><div class="mat-card"><div class="mat-card-top">
<span class="mat-icon">🖥️</span><h3>CAD/CAM Digital Workflow</h3></div><p>Digital impressions replace traditional moulds. Software-guided planning positions each implant with sub-millimeter precision. Milled frameworks eliminate human error in casting. The result: better fit, less chair time, and more predictable long-term outcomes for international patients.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="comparison" id="comparison"><div class="container"><div class="" data-anim="up">
<span class="label">Comparative Analysis</span><h2 class="title">All-on-4 vs <em>Other Solutions</em></h2><p class="desc">Understanding the clinical and practical differences helps you choose the approach best suited to your situation.</p></div><div class="compare-table-wrap " data-anim="up"><table><thead><tr><th>Criteria</th><th class="hl">All-on-4 ✦</th><th>Removable Dentures</th><th>Single Implants</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Implants required</td><td class="hl">4 per arch</td><td>None</td><td>1 per missing tooth</td></tr><tr><td>Fixation type</td><td class="hl">Fixed (permanent)</td><td>Removable</td><td>Fixed</td></tr><tr><td>Bone graft required</td><td class="hl"><span class="tag-y">Rarely needed</span></td><td><span class="tag-y">Never</span></td><td><span class="tag-n">Sometimes</span></td></tr><tr><td>Best indication</td><td class="hl">Full arch loss</td><td>Full arch loss</td><td>1–few missing teeth</td></tr><tr><td>Same-day teeth</td><td class="hl"><span class="tag-y">Yes</span></td><td><span class="tag-y">Yes</span></td><td><span class="tag-n">Variable</span></td></tr><tr><td>Bone preservation</td><td class="hl"><span class="tag-y">Excellent</span></td><td><span class="tag-n">None</span></td><td><span class="tag-y">Yes</span></td></tr><tr><td>VeaHealth cost (Istanbul)</td><td class="hl">€3,250 – €8,000</td><td>€800 – €2,500</td><td>€600 – €1,200/unit</td></tr><tr><td>10-year survival rate</td><td class="hl">>93% (implants)</td><td>Variable</td><td>>95%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="benefits" id="benefits"><div class="container"><div class="" data-anim="up">
<span class="label">Why All-on-4</span><h2 class="title">Key <em>Benefits</em></h2></div><div class="benefit-grid " data-anim="up"><div class="benefit-card"><div class="benefit-icon">🦷</div><div><h3>Stability &#038; Chewing Function</h3><p>No movement, no adhesives. Chewing efficiency approaches that of natural teeth — allowing a full diet. Implant-supported full-arch prostheses outperform removable dentures significantly in clinical chewing assessments (Pjetursson et al., 2005).</p></div></div><div class="benefit-card"><div class="benefit-icon">✨</div><div><h3>Natural Aesthetics</h3><p>Custom zirconia bridges restore natural smile line, lip support, and facial volume — preventing the &#8220;sunken face&#8221; appearance that accompanies long-term denture use. Every prosthesis is shade-matched and individually designed.</p></div></div><div class="benefit-card"><div class="benefit-icon">🦴</div><div><h3>Bone Preservation</h3><p>Osseointegrated implants stimulate the jawbone through mechanical load transfer, halting the bone resorption that naturally follows tooth loss. This maintains facial structure and long-term prosthetic fit over decades.</p></div></div><div class="benefit-card"><div class="benefit-icon">💰</div><div><h3>Cost Efficiency</h3><p>Four implants deliver a full restoration at a fraction of the cost of individual implants for each missing tooth. VeaHealth&#8217;s Istanbul pricing is 60–70% below UK and US rates — with no compromise on brand quality or clinical standards.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="tourism" id="istanbul" data-surface="dark"><div class="container"><div class="tourism-inner"><div class="" data-anim="up">
<span class="label tour-label">Dental Health Tourism</span><h2 class="tour-title">Why Istanbul<br>for <em>Your Treatment</em>?</h2><p class="tour-desc">Istanbul has emerged as one of the world&#8217;s leading dental health tourism destinations — offering internationally accredited clinics, experienced surgeons, and transparent pricing without sacrificing clinical standards.</p><ul class="tour-features"><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>60–70% savings</strong> compared to UK, US, and Western Europe — due to lower operational costs, not lower standards</div></li><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>Premium implant brands</strong> — Straumann and Nobel Biocare are standard at VeaHealth, not upgrades</div></li><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>JCI &#038; international accreditation</strong> — clinical protocols aligned with European and US standards</div></li><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>VIP concierge service</strong> — airport transfer, hotel coordination, and English-speaking team included</div></li><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>International warranty</strong> — valid in your home country, honored remotely with full documentation</div></li><li><div class="tcheck">✓</div><div><strong>Seamless remote aftercare</strong> — dedicated coordinator and digital follow-up after you return home</div></li></ul></div><div class="reveal -delay-1" data-anim="up"><div class="istanbul-card">
