<span class="label">Enhanced Restoration</span><h2 class="title">Why <em>All-on-6</em> Offers Superior Stability</h2><p class="desc">All-on-6 uses two additional implants compared to All-on-4, providing enhanced load distribution, better long-term stability, and improved outcomes for patients with moderate bone loss.</p></div><div class="why-grid " data-anim="up"><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
