<span class="label">Treatment Journey</span><h2 class="title">Your All-on-6 <em>Procedure</em></h2><p class="desc">From consultation to final prosthesis — the entire journey typically requires two visits to Istanbul over 5–6 months.</p></div><div class="proc-timeline " data-anim="up"><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">1</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Pre-Arrival</span><h3>Digital Planning</h3><p>Before you travel, VeaHealth coordinates comprehensive diagnostics — 3D CBCT scan, panoramic X-rays, and digital treatment planning. Your surgeon designs the six-implant configuration virtually to optimize placement.</p><ul><li>Medical history &#038; video consultation</li><li>3D CBCT scan &#038; X-rays analyzed</li><li>6-implant surgical guide designed</li><li>Final treatment plan confirmed</li><li>Travel &#038; hotel coordination</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">2</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 1–2 — Istanbul</span><h3>Surgery &#038; Immediate Teeth</h3><p>Under IV sedation or general anesthesia, six implants are placed per arch using 3D-guided surgery. Any failing teeth are extracted. Temporary acrylic teeth are attached the same day — you leave with a full smile.</p><ul><li>IV sedation or general anesthesia</li><li>Tooth extractions if needed</li><li>6 implants placed per arch</li><li>Immediate temporary prosthesis attached</li><li>Post-op medications &#038; instructions</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">3</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 3–7 — Istanbul</span><h3>Recovery &#038; Monitoring</h3><p>You remain in Istanbul for 5–7 days for daily check-ups. Swelling peaks at 48–72 hours. Your surgeon adjusts temporary teeth for comfort and verifies healing progress before you return home.</p><ul><li>Daily wound inspection</li><li>Suture removal (day 7–10)</li><li>Bite adjustment on temporary teeth</li><li>Pain management monitored</li><li>Soft diet guidance provided</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">4</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Month 1–4</span><h3>Osseointegration</h3><p>Implants fuse with your jawbone over 4–6 months. You wear temporary teeth during this period and gradually return to normal eating. VeaHealth monitors your healing remotely via photos and video calls.</p><ul><li>Bone integration progresses naturally</li><li>Temporary teeth remain functional</li><li>Gradual diet progression</li><li>Remote check-ins every 2 weeks</li><li>No travel required during healing</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">5</div><div class="proc-content">
