<span class="label">Essential Protection</span><h2 class="title">Why <em>Custom Night Guards</em> Are Essential</h2><p class="desc">Custom night guards protect against teeth grinding (bruxism) and TMJ disorders — preventing thousands in future dental damage while improving sleep quality and reducing jaw pain.</p></div><div class="why-grid " data-anim="up"><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Prevents Tooth Damage</h3><p>Grinding generates up to 250 pounds of force — enough to crack enamel, wear down teeth, and break fillings and crowns. A night guard absorbs this force, preventing thousands in future restorative work.</p></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Relieves TMJ Pain</h3><p>By preventing clenching, night guards reduce stress on the temporomandibular joint (TMJ). Patients report significant reduction in jaw pain, headaches, and facial tension within 2–3 weeks of consistent use.</p></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Improves Sleep Quality</h3><p>Grinding disrupts REM sleep for both you and your partner. A properly fitted guard reduces grinding frequency and intensity, leading to deeper sleep, less morning fatigue, and improved cognitive function.</p></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Cost-Effective Prevention</h3><p>A £120 night guard prevents £3,000–8,000 in future dental work (crowns, root canals, implants). Insurance actuaries calculate that every £1 spent on prevention saves £25 in restorative treatment over 10 years.</p></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"/></svg></div><h3>Perfect Custom Fit</h3><p>Unlike over-the-counter guards, custom guards are fabricated from precise digital impressions of your teeth. This ensures perfect retention, comfort, and effectiveness — no gagging, slipping, or jaw soreness.</p></div><div class="why-card"><div class="why-icon">
<svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg></div><h3>Durable &#038; Hygienic</h3><p>Medical-grade acrylic resists bacteria, staining, and odors. With proper cleaning (daily rinse, weekly soak), your guard remains hygienic and functional for 2–3 years — far longer than drugstore alternatives.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="carousel-section" id="gallery" data-surface="dark"><div class="container"><div class="" data-anim="up">
