<span class="label">Treatment Journey</span><h2 class="title">Your E-max Lumineer <em>Procedure</em></h2><p class="desc">From consultation to final bonding — the entire process typically requires one 3–5 day visit to Istanbul.</p></div><div class="proc-timeline " data-anim="up"><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">1</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 1 — Morning</span><h3>Consultation &#038; Design</h3><p>Your dentist performs a comprehensive smile assessment with digital photography and intraoral scans. Together you design your ideal smile — selecting shade, shape, and length. Digital smile design software shows you the final result before any tooth preparation.</p><ul><li>Comprehensive oral examination</li><li>Digital smile design (DSD) session</li><li>Shade matching under natural light</li><li>3D digital impressions</li><li>Treatment plan confirmation</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">2</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 1 — Afternoon</span><h3>Minimal Preparation</h3><p>Under local anesthesia (if needed), your teeth receive minimal surface preparation — typically just cleaning and light etching. For many patients, zero enamel removal is required. Temporary veneers are placed to protect teeth during fabrication.</p><ul><li>Local anesthesia (optional — often unnecessary)</li><li>Minimal surface preparation (0.2–0.3mm max)</li><li>Final digital impression scan</li><li>Temporary veneers bonded</li><li>Data sent to lab for fabrication</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">3</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 2–4</span><h3>E-max Fabrication</h3><p>Your veneers are milled from a single block of E-max lithium disilicate ceramic using CAD/CAM technology. A master ceramist applies custom layering, characterization, and glazing to match your natural teeth perfectly.</p><ul><li>3D design from digital scans</li><li>High-strength E-max block milled</li><li>Multi-layered color characterization</li><li>Surface texturing for natural reflection</li><li>Quality control and sintering</li></ul></div></div><div class="proc-step"><div class="proc-num">4</div><div class="proc-content">
<span class="proc-tag">Day 4–5</span><h3>Final Bonding</h3><p>Temporary veneers are removed and your E-max Lumineers are test-fitted. Your dentist checks fit, bite, and aesthetics. Once perfect, each veneer is bonded permanently using advanced resin adhesive under controlled isolation.</p><ul><li>Temporary veneers removed</li><li>Try-in with shade verification</li><li>Bite adjustment and edge refinement</li><li>Permanent bonding with resin cement</li><li>Final polish and care instructions</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="cost" id="pricing" data-surface="dark"><div class="container"><div class="" data-anim="up">
