<span class="rec-phase-tag">Day 2–7</span><h4>Adjustment Period</h4><ul><li>Veneers feel completely natural</li><li>Resume normal diet gradually</li><li>Any bite sensitivity resolves</li><li>Gums adapt to new contours</li><li>Full confidence when smiling</li></ul></div><div class="rec-phase"><div class="rec-phase-num">3</div>
